  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kayemor Millet Production and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crops: millet and vegetables.Beneficiaries: 705 producers, 105 women..The network&apos;s objective is to control the production and marketing of millet in a concerted manner to ensure self-sufficiency and food security by facilitating access to credit and quality inputs on time for all its members; by facilitating access to equipment, the market and contractualisation for the marketing of production; by representing members in dealings with the administrative authorities and partners. The organization has a large number of members, not all of whom have access to inputs and monitoring due to a lack of means and financial resources. This grant will enable the organization to solve the problem of seed production in quantity and access to inputs for all members; solve the problem of field agent mobility; build capacity and solve the problem of managing the quality of millet marketed. All this to achieve improved quality production at competitive prices. In this way, all members will flourish.</narrative>
  </description>
